#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:13
#: 2f01d7e90fb34db8841d33b1071726be
msgid "GPS/Compass"
msgstr "GPS/罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:15
#: e26697d614344332a4a60759275b4802
msgid ""
"GPS is usually mandatory in plane,copter,and rover vehicles, except when "
"some other position determining :ref:`sensor or system is used <common-non-"
"gps-navigation-landing-page>`. Sub does not use GPS. Compass is also usually"
" required for Copter, Rover, Sub, and QuadPlane types of Plane (see "
":ref:`common-compassless` for compass alternatives), but not for "
"Conventional Planes, however it is recommended."
msgstr ""
"GPS在固定翼、直升机和地面车辆中通常是必需的，除非使用了其他位置确定 :ref:`传感器或系统 <common-non-gps-navigation-"
"landing-page>`。潜艇类不使用GPS。罗盘在Copter、Rover、Sub和QuadPlane类型的固定翼中通常也是必需的（参见 "
":ref:`common-compassless` 了解无罗盘替代方案），但对于传统固定翼不作要求，不过建议使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:17
#: c3540413544a4790a0a80252ded7060d
msgid ""
"Some Copter and Rover modes can operate without GPS and Compass (see vehicle"
" documentation for its flight modes)."
msgstr "某些Copter和Rover模式可在无GPS和罗盘的情况下运行（参见相应飞行模式的机型文档）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:19
#: 494256e1d5f443c287b94e39548afbed
msgid ""
"Multiple GPS and/or Compasses can be used in the system, see :ref:`common-"
"gps-blending`, :ref:`common-compass-setup-advanced`, and :ref:`common-"
"ek3-affinity-lane-switching` for more information"
msgstr ""
"系统中可使用多个GPS和/或罗盘，详情参见 :ref:`common-gps-blending`、:ref:`common-compass-setup-"
"advanced` 和 :ref:`common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:24
#: 281760ff9a3e49d7b4ed4d81f1df7170
msgid "TX and RX are swapped from autopilot to GPS module."
msgstr "飞控到GPS模块的TX和RX引脚互换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:26
#: 0f38f26931f04fceb05326a317c20b6d
msgid ""
"Usually GPS is attached to the logical Serial Port 3 by default in "
"ArduPilot. However, which  physical UART is assigned to ArduPilot's Serial "
"Port 3 on the autopilot is documented in the autopilots :ref:`documentation "
"<common-autopilots>`"
msgstr ""
"通常，GPS默认连接到ArduPilot的逻辑串口3。但飞控上分配给ArduPilot串口3的物理UART，请参阅飞控的 :ref:`文档 "
"<common-autopilots>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:28
#: 95431b1aea004f4aa899e3305d4d9126
msgid ""
"It is important that a GPS be connected to the first SERIALx port that has "
"its ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` parameter set to \"5\" (GPS) since it will stop "
"searching for GPS during bootup if not found on the first port configured "
"for GPS protocol."
msgstr ""
"重要的是，GPS 必须连接到第一个将 ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` 参数设置为「5」（GPS）的 SERIALx "
"端口，因为如果在第一个配置了 GPS 协议的端口上未找到 GPS，系统将在启动时停止搜索 GPS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:31
#: 45f0d50cc7274c77a0fe394b8e2703a3
msgid ""
"As a wiring example, the topic :ref:`3DR UBlox GPS + Compass Module <common-"
"installing-3dr-ublox-gps-compass-module>` shows how to connect to a Pixhawk "
"autopilot and includes additional configuration and mounting information."
msgstr ""
"作为接线示例，:ref:`3DR UBlox GPS + Compass Module <common-installing-3dr-ublox-"
"gps-compass-module>` 主题展示了如何连接到Pixhawk飞控，并包含额外的配置和安装信息。"

