msgid "Motor/Servo Connections"
msgstr "电机/舵机连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:73
#: ee9bd8a087aa47c68c46e471c42efec5
msgid ""
"Motor ESCs and/or PWM Servos are attached to the PWM outputs of the "
"autopilot."
msgstr "电机ESC和/或PWM舵机连接到飞控的PWM输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:75
#: ddf842ecee5940799fd7d64cfd3237d5
msgid ""
"They are labeled either as MAIN/AUX outputs or just as OUTPUTs. These "
"outputs provide the PWM or Dshot signals for motor ESC or servo control of "
"flight surfaces. They can also be sometimes used as general purpose I/O pins"
" for controlling relays, parachutes, grippers, etc."
msgstr ""
"这些输出标注为MAIN/AUX输出或仅标注为OUTPUT。它们为电机ESC或舵机提供PWM或DShot信号。有时也可用作通用I/O引脚，控制继电器、降落伞、机械爪等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:77
#: e2b56b0b4fac44ce8236dcfe5628c6f9
msgid ""
"Those controllers with MAIN/AUX output labels usually indicate that a IOMCU "
"co-processor is being employed. These provide outputs intended for use as "
"the motor/servo outputs and provide a redundant means of control via RC if "
"the main autopilot fails. The MAIN outputs come from this co-processor, "
"while the AUX designated outputs are controlled directly from the autopilot."
" Most board level autopilots do not use an IOMCU and have outputs only "
"labeled OUTPUTx or Mx."
msgstr ""
"带有MAIN/AUX输出标签的飞控通常表明使用了IOMCU协处理器。这些输出用于电机/舵机控制，并在主飞控失效时通过遥控提供冗余控制手段。MAIN输出来自协处理器，而AUX输出由飞控直接控制。大多数板级飞控不使用IOMCU，其输出仅标注为OUTPUTx或Mx。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:79
#: e767affc80294d718da8dd7282cd05ea
msgid ""
"This distinction is important, since AUX outputs(and OUTPUTs from autopilots"
" without an IOMCU) can be used as GPIOs as well as PWM or Dshot. While MAIN "
"outputs can only be used for PWM."
msgstr ""
"这一区别很重要，因为AUX输出（以及无IOMCU飞控的OUTPUT）可用作GPIO，也可用作PWM或DShot。而MAIN输出只能用于PWM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:81
#: 4afea98530494c6ea0ee3e0207836235
msgid ""
"A few autopilots that do NOT use an IOMCU label their outputs as MAIN, so "
"actually do have the capability of use as GPIOs and/or Dshot ESC control "
"outputs. CUAV V5 Nano and Holybro Pixhawk 4 Mini are examples."
msgstr ""
"少数不使用IOMCU的飞控将其输出标注为MAIN，实际上这些输出具备GPIO和/或DShot ESC控制输出能力。CUAV V5 "
"Nano和Holybro Pixhawk 4 Mini就是典型例子。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-flight-controller-wiring.rst:83
#: 7f357989f2fa497dbcbc572714148f28
msgid ""
"Often these outputs are provided on 3 pin connector strips supplying or "
"distributing servo power and ground, in addition to the individual output "
"signals. This power is usually provided externally, such as by the ESC or a "
"BEC, although some autopilots provide this power from internal regulators."
msgstr ""
"这些输出通常通过3针连接器排提供，分配舵机电源和地线，并提供各自的输出信号。电源通常由外部供给，例如由ESC或BEC提供，但部分飞控通过内部稳压器供电。"

